    <apiVersion>66.0</apiVersion>
    <description>When a claim line (Budget Allocation) is created or changed, routes it through the Flow Tool Kit Budget Trigger Handler, which recomputes the value's actual amount (and quantity) from every allocation on the value and the disbursement's amount from every allocation on the disbursement in fundable categories. Every row counts; a canceled claim is cleared by the org's own automation. No entry filter: the handler converges, so unchanged figures write nothing.</description>
